class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/340840/extras/c9d5b802294a6ff3bab66b34ef13cd62.poster.avif?t=1667029453\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/340840/extras/c9d5b802294a6ff3bab66b34ef13cd62.webm?t=1667029453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/340840/extras/c9d5b802294a6ff3bab66b34ef13cd62.mp4?t=1667029453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Features</strong>:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Story-driven nonlinear narrative<br></li><li>Survival and exploration based gameplay<br></li><li>Disturbing and ominous atmosphere <br></li><li>Solve puzzles and collect evidence<br></li><li>Alternative endings</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/340840/extras/58681270b043cf672d22b4a508fa958a.poster.avif?t=1667029453\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/340840/extras/58681270b043cf672d22b4a508fa958a.webm?t=1667029453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/340840/extras/58681270b043cf672d22b4a508fa958a.mp4?t=1667029453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
